{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILP","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILP","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILP","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L34-L49","doc":"**Universal ILP Algorithm** (pattern C — named, not asserted).\n\n**Content statement** (from manuscript): *a single integer linear\nprogram selects the operator at every level of the QOU construction;\nthe same Gram matrix $G$, the same Frobenius check $Gx \\geq 0$, and\nthe same ILP are applied to quarks, nucleons, atoms, and molecules.*\n\nThe structural reading is that there are exactly four construction\nlevels and the ILP Gram dimension is constant across them.  We\n**name** this as a `Prop` over the context's primitive data, rather\nthan projecting it from self-assuming `h_*` fields — an instance of\nthis proposition is the open structural claim. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:universal-ilp-algorithm","label":"def:universal-ilp-algorithm","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/universal-ilp-algorithm.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.gram_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.gram_dim","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L32-L32","doc":"ILP Gram matrix dimension per level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.n_levels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.n_levels","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Number of construction levels (quarks, nucleons, atoms,\nmolecules). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.N","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.Z","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.UniversalILPContext","kind":"class","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/UniversalILP.lean#L17-L32","doc":"Carrier for the `UniversalILP` data — only the primitive,\nnon-conclusory fields (pattern C): the construction-level count\nand the per-level ILP Gram-matrix dimension.  The conclusion\n(`n_levels = 4`, dimension constant across levels) is **not** a\nfield here — it is the named proposition `UniversalILP` below, so\nthe claim is stated, not self-assumed. ","signatureChunk":0}]}